    {
      "id": "DK4_SAILING_DECLARE_WAR_MODE_PANEL_V1",
      "source_address": "02147674",
      "pointer_site": "0206F420",
      "source_allocation_bytes_including_NUL": 257,
      "source_japanese": "宣戦モード。画面上の艦隊・街に戦闘をしかけます。攻撃対象を選ぶと、戦闘開始です。宣戦すると、自動的に相手勢力との関係が交戦中になり、友好度が大きく下がります。同盟中の勢力の艦隊には宣戦できません。",
      "heading": "Declare War Mode",
      "english": "Pick a fleet or town on screen. Attacking starts a war with its faction and sharply reduces goodwill. You can't declare war on allied fleets.",
      "context": "A third Y press selects Declare War Mode. Targets are fleets/cities on the lower screen; the tested empty target area displays the original no-target message separately.",
      "source_meaning": "Selecting a fleet/city starts combat and changes faction relations to at war with a large goodwill penalty. Allied fleets cannot be targeted.",
      "localization_note": "Give the target selection first, then state the consequence and keep the alliance restriction limited to fleets.",
      "native_capture_frame": 18400,
      "review": {
        "source": true,
        "context": true,
        "localization": true,
        "naturalness": true,
        "formatting": true
      },
      "source_hex": "",
      "previous_English": "Select a fleet or city on screen to begin a battle. Declaring war puts you at war with that faction and greatly lowers goodwill. You cannot declare war on an allied faction's fleets.",
